    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN THE DISCORD - CHAT WITH THE DEVS!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Valand is a city-building simulator.<br><br>You have nothing except your arms and legs. However, it can't be very simple.<br><br>Barbarians are raging in the world and they are hungry for profit and easy money, your safety is above all. Rebuild houses, develop your own army, build a huge fence around your territory and do everything to survive.<br><br>Game Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\u25aa Dynamic day/night system</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\u25aa Ability to build your own settlement</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\u25aa Creation of an entire army of Vikings, ready to repel enemies</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\u25aa Open world with longship travel option</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\u25aa Economic system with exciting resource earning</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\u25aa Game atmosphere built in the spirit of the Viking Age</ul>",
